# Generated book content. The export script in the private workspace writes these for each
# book with `online: true` in books.yaml. They stay out of git until the author has
# authorised publication. To publish a book: remove its two lines below, then set
# `online: true` in books.yaml. See website/README.md, "Publishing a book".
src/content/docs/applied-ai-engineering/*.md
public/books/applied-ai-engineering/
